7,"Itneg, Maeng Language (ITT) – L1 & L2 Speakers, Status, Map, Endangered Level & Official Use | Ethnologue Free",https://www.ethnologue.com/language/itt/,Maeng Itneg is a stable indigenous language of the Philippines. It belongs to the Austronesian language family. The language is used as a first language by all in the ethnic community. It is not known to be taught in schools.,"Itneg, Maeng",Austronesian
